    { "id": "pro-6", "moduleId": "korean_proverbs", "type": "sentence", "target": "돌다리도 두들겨 보고 건너라.", "pronunciation": "doldarido dudeulgyeo bogo geonneora.", "translation": "Look before you leap (Lit: Tap even a stone bridge before crossing)." },

    { "id": "t2p-1", "moduleId": "topik2_passages", "type": "sentence", "target": "한국은 봄, 여름, 가을, 겨울의 사계절이 있습니다. 봄에는 예쁜 꽃이 피고 날씨가 따뜻합니다.", "pronunciation": "hangugeun bom, yeoreum, gaeul, gyeoureui sagaejeori isseumnida. bomeneun yeppeun kkoti pigo nalssiga ttatteut-hamnida.", "translation": "Korea has four seasons: spring, summer, autumn, and winter. In spring, pretty flowers bloom and the weather is warm." },
    { "id": "t2p-2", "moduleId": "topik2_passages", "type": "sentence", "target": "한글은 세종대왕이 1443년에 만든 한국의 문자입니다. 한글은 배우기 쉽고 과학적인 글자입니다.", "pronunciation": "hangeureun sejongdaewangi 1443nyeone mandeun hangugui munjaimnida. hangeureun baeugi swipgo gwahakjeogin geuljaimnida.", "translation": "Hangeul is the Korean alphabet created by King Sejong in 1443. Hangeul is easy to learn and scientific." },
    { "id": "t2p-3", "moduleId": "topik2_passages", "type": "sentence", "target": "지난 주말에 친구와 함께 제주도로 여행을 갔습니다. 제주도의 푸른 바다가 참 아름다웠습니다.", "pronunciation": "jinan jumare chinguwa hamkke jejudoro yeohaengeul gatseumnida. jejudoe pureun badaga cham areumdawotseumnida.", "translation": "Last weekend I went on a trip to Jeju Island with my friend. Jeju Island's blue sea was very beautiful." },
    { "id": "t2p-4", "moduleId": "topik2_passages", "type": "sentence", "target": "저는 아침 일곱 시에 일어나서 운동을 합니다. 아침을 먹고 지하철을 타고 회사에 갑니다.", "pronunciation": "jeoneun achim ilgop sie ireonaseo eundongeul hamnida. achimeul meokgo jihacheoreul tago hoesae gamnida.", "translation": "I wake up at seven in the morning and exercise. After eating breakfast, I take the subway to work." },
    { "id": "t2p-5", "moduleId": "topik2_passages", "type": "sentence", "target": "정직한 나무꾼이 산에서 나무를 하다가, 실수로 쇠도끼를 호수에 빠뜨렸습니다.", "pronunciation": "jeongjikan namukkuni saneseo namureul hadaga, silsuro soedokkireul hosue ppattryeotseumnida.", "translation": "An honest woodcutter accidentally dropped his iron axe into a lake while chopping wood in the mountains." }
  ]
}
